    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on levin-2014-tumor-09: needs-new-data, resolvability 0.41";
    dc:description "The prediction is experimentally clear, but the existing experiments manipulate remote voltage and observe tumors rather than measuring signals emitted by tumors. New longitudinal bioelectric data are required.";
    dc:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/dataset-resolvability-0.2.0>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Map Vmem at defined distances and times before and after inducing tumors, then remove or inhibit tumors and test whether remote electrical signatures disappear. A reproducible tumor-specific remote signal would support bidirectionality.";
